{"nodes":[{"id":"textInput-1781485543816-csvzphb","type":"textInput","position":{"x":-5818.448485586236,"y":-1417.1049176444876},"data":{"label":"TEXT1","tags":[],"resourceId":"textInput-node-1781160859515","value":"Create a recording from the audience at an outdoor Japanese theater performance. On stage, we see a young Japanese actor portraying Naruto standing several meters in front of another young actor portraying Sasuke. Both are clearly visible, in high resolution, and positioned as if they are about to fight","__displayModelVersion":2},"width":1387,"height":127,"style":{"width":400,"height":240},"className":"","measured":{"width":1387,"height":127},"selected":true,"dragging":false},{"id":"textInput-1781485543816-8ekfat4","type":"textInput","position":{"x":-5834.031253659841,"y":-2110.9942873057857},"data":{"label":"TEXT2","tags":[],"resourceId":"textInput-node-1781160897925","value":"POV handheld shot from someone in the audience filming with a phone camera, frame slightly unsteady, raised above other people's heads in the crowd. An outdoor stage performance — a wooden stage with elaborate scenic design recreating an ancient Japanese ninja village gate, sculpted rock formations, large wooden doors with kanji circles, traditional thatched-roof structures, bamboo and trees in the background, kanji on the wall to the left. A large audience fills the foreground, dark-haired heads silhouetted, many holding up phones and small cameras recording the show.\n\nTwo young performers on stage: on the left, a young man with spiky blond hair, a metal headband with a leaf symbol, wearing a bright orange-and-blue tracksuit-style outfit, in a fighting stance. On the right, a young man with spiky black hair, wearing a dark blue shirt and white shorts, also in a fighting stance.\n\n0s–4s: The POV sways with handheld phone camera shake. Both performers simultaneously sprint toward each other across the stage at full speed, meeting in the middle in a clash of fast, precise martial arts choreography — punches, blocks, spinning kicks, dodges, exchanged at impressive speed. They move like trained fighters, weaving and striking with athletic skill, dust kicking up from the wooden stage. The audience gasps and cheers.\n\n4s–7s: The exchange escalates — both performers throw a powerful straight punch at the exact same moment, their fists colliding mid-air with a thunderous impact. A shockwave bursts outward from the connection. Both performers leap backward in synchronized flips, landing in fighting stances on opposite ends of the stage, breathing heavily. The audience erupts in applause.\n\n7s–10s: The black-haired performer straightens up, smirks confidently, brushes his hair back, and says in Japanese with an arrogant tone: \"お前は俺のレベルじゃない。\"\n\nThe blond performer grins fiercely and replies in Japanese: \"それはどうかな！\"\n\n10s–13s: The blond performer brings his hands together in a quick ninja hand sign and concentrates. Suddenly, with a burst of smoke and a sharp pop, two identical clones appear on either side of him, materializing instantly. All three figures drop into the same fighting stance simultaneously, grinning confidently. The black-haired performer’s eyes widen slightly in surprise. The audience erupts into massive cheers and applause.\n\nTechnical specs: modern smartphone vertical-style handheld footage from an audience perspective, slight digital noise, natural outdoor daylight, shallow focus on the stage with crowd silhouettes in the foreground, continuous shot from a fixed audience position. Ambient sound includes audience gasps and cheers, rapid martial arts impacts, the thunderous fist collision, dramatic dialogue, the supernatural pop of the clones appearing, and overwhelming applause.","__displayModelVersion":2},"width":1419,"height":636,"style":{"width":400,"height":240},"className":"","measured":{"width":1419,"height":636},"selected":true,"dragging":false},{"id":"imageGeneration-1781485543816-vq4y0w4","type":"imageGeneration",